or remaining-at-home spouse); Medicaid then covers custodial nursing home care permanently. Key distinction: **Medicare covers skilled care; Medicaid covers custodial/long-term care**. (Ref: Hazzard''s Ch. 17; Current Diagnosis & Treatment: Geriatrics; AGS Geriatrics At Your Fingertips; UWorld Step 2 CK)'),
