riggered by dependence in ≥2 of 6 ADLs or cognitive impairment; (5) **Penetration rate**: very low (~7–8%); the long-term care financing gap is a major national policy challenge. The ideal time to purchase is in one''s 50s–early 60s, while still insurable. (Ref: Hazzard''s Ch. 17; AGS Geriatrics At Your Fingertips; Current Diagnosis & Treatment: Geriatrics)'),
